  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2F4E" flags="0x0">
    <title>4C 7 08 TPS ADC value lookup after offset</title>
    <description>TPS is processed by tables at 4c708 and 4c730 in a similar way but there are a couple of offsets added before the ADC value lookup (one must be the &quot;reset TPS&quot; offset, but not sure about the other) and then there is a myriad of processing after the TPS degrees value is looked up before it becomes our recognised TPS value. The strange table at 4c762 is involved in this along with a dozen or so other values...&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;The 5AM uses a linear approximation between 20 points - firstly to convert the adc value to a notional position in 20 steps (table 4c708) and then to convert this position to a degree value (table 4c730).&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Indexed by (tps_raw_D9FE+tps_raw_ofs_DD4E+TPS_raw_offset_4C758)</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="1" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="4" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="15" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>raw value</units>
      <indexcount>20</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>1</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>2</outputtype>
      <datatype>57</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="1" />
      <LABEL index="1" value="2" />
      <LABEL index="2" value="3" />
      <LABEL index="3" value="4" />
      <LABEL index="4" value="5" />
      <LABEL index="5" value="6" />
      <LABEL index="6" value="7" />
      <LABEL index="7" value="8" />
      <LABEL index="8" value="9" />
      <LABEL index="9" value="10" />
      <LABEL index="10" value="11" />
      <LABEL index="11" value="12" />
      <LABEL index="12" value="13" />
      <LABEL index="13" value="14" />
      <LABEL index="14" value="15" />
      <LABEL index="15" value="16" />
      <LABEL index="16" value="17" />
      <LABEL index="17" value="18" />
      <LABEL index="18" value="19" />
      <LABEL index="19" value="20" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <indexcount>1</indexcount>
