  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3F19" flags="0x0">
    <title>4D 7 B0 Idle Fuel Table</title>
    <description>Values here replace the Main Fuel values in the rpm range above 600rpm (I haven&apos;t tested below that speed) to 2700 (if engine speed decreases) or ~2780 rpm (if engne speed increases) while TPS is closed (Status 7). As the status 7 strays with the TPS learning, idle fuel values can be active at TPS settings well above the lowest one contained in the TPS legend.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="1" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="5" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="2" category="10" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
